   "tag": "p",
   "text": "The Shrine of the Book is this museum's own wing and is counted here. The museum has no open catalogue API and its object photography is all rights reserved, so nothing was fetched from it; the records are from the open catalogues and Wikidata, and any photograph is a Wikimedia Commons photograph of the object."
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "64 records are held for this collection and 24 are listed here — the ones its own records tie to something biblical, audited first. The rest are in the research corpus, not on this page."
  },
